<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the opening day of</p>
<p>the first test between South Africa and India at Kingsmead on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>South Africa first innings</p>
<p> A.Hudson c Mongia b Ganguly			  80</p>
<p> G.Kirsten b Prasad					2</p>
<p> A.Bacher lbw b Srinath				 25</p>
<p> D.Cullinan c Mongia b Prasad			  1</p>
<p> H.Cronje c Mongia b Prasad			   15</p>
<p> H.Gibbs c Mongia b Johnson			    0</p>
<p> B.McMillan lbw b Johnson			     34</p>
<p> S.Pollock not out					23</p>
<p> D.Richardson b Prasad				  24</p>
<p> L.Klusener c Mongia b Srinath			 1</p>
<p> A.Donald c Rathore b Prasad			   5</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-10 nb-11)			     25</p>
<p> Total (all out in 86 overs)			 235</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-8 2-70 3-71 4-99 5-113 6-162 7-190 8-229</p>
<p>9-230.</p>
<p>Bowling: Srinath 20-7-36-2, Prasad 19-6-60-5 (2-nb), Johnson</p>
<p>15-2-52-2 (9-nb), Tendulkar 2.4-2-0-0, Kumble 20.2-3-61-0,</p>
<p>Ganguly 9-4-12-1.</p>
<p>India first innings</p>
<p> V.Rathore not out				     2</p>
<p> W.Raman not out					 0</p>
<p> Extras						    0</p>
<p> Total (for no wicket)				 2</p>
<p>To bat: S.Ganguly, S.Tendulkar, M.Azharuddin, R.Dravid,</p>
<p>N.Mongia, A.Kumble, J.Srinath, D.Johnson, V.Prasad.</p>
<p>Bowling: Donald 1-0-1-0, Pollock 1-0-1-0.</p>
</text>
